OL,3,GNEWSA'New powers' for Thames Valley in
OL,4,Adevolution plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA devolution plan, which could bring
OL,7,Fnew powers and increased funding to
OL,8,Fleaders in the Thames Valley, is poised
OL,9,Fto become a reality.
OL,11,FEarlier this week, Liberal Democrat
OL,12,Fleaders of Oxfordshire and Windsor and
OL,13,FMaidenhead councils wrote to the
OL,14,Fgovernment to confirm their hopes for a
OL,15,FThames Valley devolved area, which
OL,16,Fwould include Swindon.
OL,18,FChancellor John Healey confirmed in his
OL,19,Fbudget earlier that the government was
OL,20,Fin the final stages of agreeing 10 new
OL,21,Fdevolution deals, which would include
OL,22,Fthe Thames Valley.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
