OL,3,GNEWSA'New powers' for Thames Valley in
OL,4,Adevolution plan
OL,5,
OL,6,F"[These are] new powers to the people
OL,7,Fwho know their areas best ` not
OL,8,Fsentimentality but supply-side
OL,9,Feconomics. The biggest wave of
OL,10,Fdevolution in a generation," Healey
OL,11,Fsaid.
